ponseMessage checkResult = pmcSupplierAdmClient.commonCheckData(query, \"calculateFinancing\");\n        if (ResponseMessage.FAIL.equals(checkResult.getStatus())) {\n            return checkResult;\n        }\n        // 3. 调用银行接口进行测算\n        if (PayBankConstants.CMB_BANK_CODE.equals(query.getBankCode())) {\n            return cmbClient.financingCalculate(query);\n        } else  if (PayBankConstants.CMBC_BANK_CODE.equals(query.getBankCode())) {\n            return cmbcClient.financingCalculate(query);\n        } else {\n            return ResponseMessage.fail(\"参数错误：不支持的银行编码\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 提交融资申请\n     * @param applyDTO 包含银行编码等融资申请信息\n     * @return 申请提交结果\n     */\n    @Override\n    public ResponseMessage submitFinancingApply(PmcFinanceBankBaseQO applyDTO) {\n        // 1. 参数校验\n        if (applyDTO == null || applyDTO.getBankCode() == null) {\n            return ResponseMessage.fail(\"参数错误：申请信息不完整\");\n        }\n        // 3. 提交申请\n        if (PayBankConstants.CMB_BANK_CODE.equals(applyDTO.getBankCode())) {\n            return cmbClient.submitFinancingApply(applyDTO);\n        } else  if (PayBankConstants.CMBC_BANK_CODE.equals(applyDTO.getBankCode())) {\n            return cmbcClient.submitFinancingApply(applyDTO);\n        } else {\n            return ResponseMessage.fail(\"参数错误：不支持的银行编码\");\n        }\n\n        // 4. 返回申请结果\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 通过详情信息提交融资申请\n     * @param detail 包含申请单、付款单和供应商信息的Map\n     * @return 申请提交结果\n     */\n    @Override\n    public ResponseMessage submitFinancingApplyByDetail(Map<String, Object> detail) {\n        final String methodName = \"submitFinancingApplyByDetail\";\n        PmcFinanceBankBaseQO assembledRequest = null;\n        // 1. 参数组装\n        assembledRequest = assembleFinancingRequest(detail);\n\n        // 2. 参数校验\n        if (StringUtils.isBlank(assembledRequest.getBankCode())) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"银行编码不能为空\");\n        }\n        ResponseMessage responseMessage = submitFinancingApply(assembledRequest);\n        // 3. 处理银行响应\n        if (ResponseMessage.FAIL.equals(responseMessage.getStatus())) {\n            log.warn(\"[{}] 银行接口调用失败，开始回滚本地状态，申请单号：{}，错误原因：{}\",\n                    methodName, assembledRequest.getApplyNumber(), responseMessage.getMessage());\n            updateApplyStatusOrBankApplyNumber(assembledRequest);\n            return ResponseMessage.fail(\"银行处理失败：\" + responseMessage.getMessage());\n        }\n        return responseMessage;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 执行本地状态回滚操作\n     */\n    private void updateApplyStatusOrBankApplyNumber(PmcFinanceBankBaseQO request) {\n        try {\n            ResponseMessage rollback = pmcSupplierAdmClient.updateApplyStatusOrBankApplyNumber(request);\n            if (ResponseMessage.FAIL.equals(rollback.getStatus())) {\n                log.error(\"更新本地记录失败，申请单号：{}，错误信息：{}\",\n                    request.getApplyNumber(), rollback.getMessage());\n            }\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            log.error(\"更新本地记录时发生异常，申请单号：{}\", request.getApplyNumber(), e);\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 查询融资结果\n     * @param query 包含银行编码等查询条件\n     * @return 融资结果信息\n     */\n    @Override\n    public ResponseMessage queryFinancingResult(PmcFinanceBankBaseQO query) {\n        // 1. 参数校验\n        if (query == null || query.getBankCode() == null) {\n            return ResponseMessage.fail(\"参数错误：银行编码不能为空\");\n        }\n\n        // 2 通用业务校验\n        ResponseMessage checkResult = pmcSupplierAdmClient.commonCheckData(query, \"queryFinancingResult\");\n        if (ResponseMessage.FAIL.equals(checkResult.getStatus())) {\n            return checkResult;\n        }\n        // 3. 查询融资结果\n        if (PayBankConstants.CMB_BANK_CODE.equals(query.getBankCode())) {\n            return cmbClient.queryFinancingResult(query);\n        } else  if (PayBankConstants.CMBC_BANK_CODE.equals(query.getBankCode())) {\n            return cmbcClient.queryFinancingResult(query);\n        } else 